### ========================================
### 5. TRANSAKSI (Payment & Laporan)
### ========================================
### POST Tambah Transaksi (Pembayaran)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "booking_id": 1,
    "payment_method": "cash",
    "amount_paid": 250000,
    "payment_status": "paid",
    "notes": "Pelunasan tunai"
}

### GET Laporan Keuangan
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions/report?from=2026-10-01&to=2026-10-31
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}
